### Preamble & Scientific Intent
This repository, including all foundational papers, theoretical derivations, preregistrations, metrological protocols, algorithms, and simulation software of the **ELPH-N · Elephant In Neuron** program, is released under an open academic framework dedicated to **scientific non-commercial inquiry, experimental replication, educational instruction, and open research verification**.

Commercial exploitation, proprietary closed-source redistribution, or commercial use without prior explicit written agreement from the author is strictly prohibited.

